    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> War sphere, lay on hands class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may spend a spell point to rally an ally, and use your lay on hands class feature on them. This costs the normal number of uses of your lay on hands class feature in addition to the spell point cost of the rally, but does not require the ally to be within the normal range of your lay on hands ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/war#toc128\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
